<title>UK: BayerHypo adds 100 bln lire to 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo adds 100 bln lire to 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 400 bln lire from 300 bln lire, lead manager IMI Luxembourg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *100 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    04.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.235   PAY DATE  **27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES   *FUNGIBLE WITH 300 BLN LIRE BOND LAUNCHED ON 09.JAN.97</p>
<p>	  **PLUS 113 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
